          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [
            {
              "bbox": [
                0.139,
                0.773,
                0.434,
                0.791
              ],
              "content": "Plants make food Drying of clothes"
            }
          ],
          "image_source": "images/page_7_image_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.253,
            0.805,
            0.885,
            0.889
          ],
          "content": "One afternoon, Bhoomi and Surya pass by the field near Ajji’s house, where they see a cow grazing the grass. They talk about the Sun being the main source of energy. Read the conversation carefully and answer."
        },
